{"speciesId":511,"names":{"fr":"Feuillajou","es":"Pansage","en":"Pansage","ja":"ヤナップ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit dans les forêts profondes. Manger la feuille qui pousse sur sa tête fait disparaître la fatigue."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon dwells deep in the forest. Eating a leaf from its head whisks weariness away as if by magic."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les feuilles qui poussent sur sa tête soignent la fatigue. Il en donne aux Pokémon affaiblis."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It shares the leaf on its head with weary-looking Pokémon. These leaves are known to relieve stress."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les feuilles qui poussent sur sa tête soignent la fatigue. Il en donne aux Pokémon affaiblis."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Comparte las hojas de su cabeza con Pokémon agotados. Posee la facultad de aliviar el cansancio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It shares the leaf on its head with weary-looking Pokémon. These leaves are known to relieve stress."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"元気の ない ポケモンに 頭の 葉っぱを 分け与える。 疲れを 取る 効果が あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est très doué pour trouver des Baies et aime les partager avec ses amis sans rien demander en échange."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es todo un experto en la búsqueda de bayas y es tan gentil que las comparte con todos sus compañeros."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"木の実を 探すのが 上手で あちこちで 集めて 仲間に 分